{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01007","headline":"横吹曲辞 长安道 · 薛能","name":"横吹曲辞 长安道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汲汲复营营，东西连两京。\n关繻古若在，山岳累应成。\n各自有身事，不相知姓名。\n交驰喧衆类，分散入重城。\n此路去无尽，万方人始生。\n空余片言苦，来往觅刘桢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}